Sound stage 2 (spescodec=2): stock RX macro registers, WCD937x init and AUX DAC.

all23: stage 1 brought the codec up (SoundWire slaves rx/va 4, ids 01170224/01170223). With
spescodec=2, and only when the VA bus has its slave, the RX macro gets the stock Android table,
RX0..2 are muted, the WCD937x is initialised over the VA bus (dev 1) with its RX clocks and AUX
DAC on and RX2's volume set (Topaz 0145 steps 8-9). Still silent until the stream.

